# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
# *.exe we want these for VMS image files
*.exe~

*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/govax

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Local-only simh/real-VMS disk containers (docs/PHASE-22.md) — large binary
# blobs containing licensed VAX/VMS code, symlinked or copied in here for
# manual cross-simulator validation on this dev machine only, never committed.
/testdata/disks/*
!/testdata/disks/README.md

# Real VMS 7.3 STARLET.REQ (BLISS symbol definitions) and rmsdef.h (C header),
# both extracted from a live VMS system, used as a one-time reference for
# exact $FABDEF/$RABDEF/$RMSDEF values while implementing Phase 22
# (docs/PHASE-22.md) — never to be committed.
/starlet.req
/rmsdef.h

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
